# 统一按文本处理、LF 换行；Windows 上检出也保持 LF，避免固件里混入 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ino   text
*.cpp   text
*.h     text
*.hpp   text
*.py    text
*.md    text
*.yml   text
*.yaml  text
*.json  text

# 原始位图：二进制，别做任何换行/编码转换
*.bin   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary

